        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You automatically sense the presence and approximate strength of undead, haunts, spirits, and incorporeal creatures within <strong>60 feet</strong>, even through thin barriers, without learning their exact location &mdash; they are <strong>hidden</strong> to you rather than undetected.</p><p>You can see and target incorporeal creatures normally.</p><p>You are also trained in <strong>Spirit Lore</strong>: souls, the afterlife, haunts, and hollow-things.</p>"
